d its state is NOT persisted. A localStorage
   open-state key is worth nothing here and is one more thing that can be wrong.

   ⚠️ The drawer sits AFTER the plot, never above it. clvShowTip measures
   #clvSvg.getBoundingClientRect().width to decide which side of the cursor the tooltip
   goes on; anything that reflows the plot when it opens moves the tooltip with it. */
.clv-foot .live{margin:0}
.clv-foot .method{margin:9px 0 0}
.clv-foot .method > summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:5px 0;
  font:700 10.5px/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--accent)}
.clv-foot .method > summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.clv-foot .method > summary::after{content:" ↓"}
.clv-foot .method[open] > summary::after{content:" ↑"}
.clv-foot .method > summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.clv-foot .method-body{padding:4px 0 2px;line-height:1.7}
