   ⚠️ These were type="number". On Android that hands up a digits-only keypad with NO
   minus key, so a favourite — every legal Bozo price — simply could not be entered on
   the device most members submit from. They are text with a numeric inputmode instead:
   same digit-first keypad, but the field will hold a sign. Where both signs are legal
   the ± button supplies it; the Price box needs no button because the band is
   favourites-only, so a bare 238 can only have meant -238 and is read that way. */
.pxin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;min-width:0}
